  "goodToKnow": "Das Industriegebiet is an industrial area or estate, often on a town's edge with factories, warehouses and big stores. Das Gewerbegebiet is a business park with smaller firms; the zoning plan (Bebauungsplan) separates these from Wohngebiete (residential areas). The Ruhrgebiet was once Europe's biggest industrial region of coal and steel. Plural: die Industriegebiete."
